WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:41.770
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.480
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.490
<i>continue their adventure.</i>

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:55.990
<i>The scattered Chosen Ones aim to reunite
with one another.</i>

00:01:55.990 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>While Takeru and Patamon dash across
a continent where only the strong survive,</i>

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.080
<i>danger was closing in on them.</i>

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.950
FANGMON

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:46.380
Oh...

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.010
Patamon?

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.630
Patamon!

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:57.110
SOARING HOPE

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.140
Hang in there, Patamon!

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.440
Patamon!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.360
Takeru-kun!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.530
You okay, Takeru?!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.370
Taichi-san...

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:24.870
Are you all right?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.460
Sora-san...

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.190
Birdramon!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.730
Meteor Wing!

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.570
Fangmon, a Champion Digimon.

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:49.640
Greymon!

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.110
Mega Flame!

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:59.860
Keep shooting!
Greymon, aim for the feet!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.200
Alright!

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:05.870
Birdramon!

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.170
Okay!

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.590
Now!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.940
I see, so you were able to join them.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.480
<i>Were you hurt, Takeru?</i>

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:39.820
I'm fine, but Patamon's...

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.280
Patamon looks in pain.

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.330
What's wrong?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:50.000
It's probably the damage
from fighting Darkknightmon.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:52.670
<i>Takeru.</i>

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.720
<i>I'm sure Patamon will get well soon.</i>

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:00.010
<i>Until then, you stay by Patamon's side.</i>

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:04.640
Yeah! I will, Yamato!

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.260
<i>Taichi, I leave Takeru to you.</i>

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.520
Yeah.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.140
Now, what about Mimi-chan's side?

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.520
<i>Go! That's it!</i>

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.650
Huh?

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.000
Mimi-chan?

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.130
Keep going! It's working!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.400
That's it! There!

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:29.290
Togemon versus Golemon!
Now for the climax!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.800
Kaboom!

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.540
It's pretty lively over there.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.420
Sounds fun.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.600
And Joe Senpai?

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:51.940
Help me please!

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.940
BLOSSOMON

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:56.060
Joe!

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.350
<i>Ah! It's digging in! It's digging in!</i>

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:00.270
<i>The blood's coming to my head!</i>

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:02.690
<i>Wait, is it rushing down? Which is it?!</i>

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.450
<i>It's going up! No, down!</i>

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.120
Is he all right?

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.470
Let's trust Gomamon.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:10.870
<i>Everybody!</i>

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.930
Koshiro!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:16.000
<i>There's been a shift
in our world's situation!</i>

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:29.470
The information of the ISS possibly
colliding with the artificial satellites

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:31.600
seems to have been leaked.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:32.730
<i>"What's gonna happen to Japan?"</i>

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:37.620
And now the entire internet's buzzing,
flooding with theories and fake news.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:41.110
Possibly due to that,
the dark energy's intensity is...

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.630
<i>The intensity is increasing!</i>

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:51.090
Sounds like it's going
to be more disastrous than before.

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:04.800
<i>Patamon.</i>

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.180
<i>Oh, Holy Digimon.</i>

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.610
<i>Can you hear my voice?</i>

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.350
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:23.270
<i>No, I know this voice.</i>

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:26.620
<i>But I can't remember...</i>

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:47.920
<i>The dark abyss, reincarnation, war...</i>

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.660
<i>This must be the cost
of surviving many difficulties.</i>

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:57.810
<i>Seems like a great deal of your powers
as well as your memories have been lost.</i>

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.570
<i>I can't... anymore...</i>

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.980
<i>Do not give up.</i>

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:10.780
<i>The Holy Digimon and the Chosen Ones...</i>

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:13.910
<i>Unite your hearts and walk forth together,</i>

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:18.160
<i>then you shall open a new path.</i>

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.880
<i>With... Takeru?</i>

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.340
<i>Oh, wait...</i>

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.840
<i>We are those of the past.</i>

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:35.220
<i>An empty existence
with no power but to speak now.</i>

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:40.310
<i>Patamon, the one who is alive today
who possess the holy powers.</i>

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:46.150
<i>Become the light.
The light of hope to brighten the world.</i>

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:50.740
Hope...

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.830
Patamon!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:14.800
The light of hope...

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.600
to brighten the world.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:39.710
But at this rate,
I can't protect Takeru and everybody...

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:47.420
Hey, can you swim, Patamon?

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.460
Huh?

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:52.350
You know, I couldn't swim before.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:55.180
Takeru?

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:59.160
I was scared of the water
and I had a weak body too.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:05.190
But my brother told me,
"Takeru, you'll be able to swim soon."

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:11.360
Yamato was always by my side
until I was able to swim.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:17.470
I'll be by your side, Patamon.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.220
Takeru...

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.230
Something's coming!

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.800
Fangmon again!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.520
Whoa!

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:45.690
If they catch us, will we be eaten?

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:47.560
Agumon!

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:48.540
Yeah!

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:53.450
Agumon Evolution!

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.370
Greymon!

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:59.080
Let's go, Greymon!

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:05.000
There's a strange cloud...

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.730
What is that?!

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:05.700
CERBERUMON

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:09.660
So that's the Fangmon's boss!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.730
That's Cerberumon.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.570
An Ultimate Digimon!

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.120
Komondomon, dodge to the left!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.550
If we're hit by that, we're done for!

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:42.510
Greymon, you okay?!

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:43.810
Yeah!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.150
Why you...

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.150
Greymon!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:06.510
Shoot... I messed up.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.170
Here it comes again!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.100
Komondomon, go right!

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:24.180
Faster, Komondomon, or we'll be roasted!

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:28.050
Piyomon, you ready?

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:29.270
Yeah!

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:33.750
Piyomon Evolution!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.520
Birdramon!

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:38.360
Meteor Wing!

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:55.410
Dodge to the right!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.170
Go left! Left!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.650
That's it, Komondomon!

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:06.420
What's that?!

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:08.560
Something even stronger's coming!

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:15.070
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.570
Metalgreymon!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.660
Giga Storm!

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:52.200
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.950
Garudamon!

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:00.690
So strong...

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.610
Garudamon!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.370
Metalgreymon!

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.360
Right!

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:28.690
Left!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.140
Left!

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:37.110
Takeru-kun, Patamon,
this place is dangerous, so go insi--

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:48.800
Sora, Takeru, Patamon, you guys okay?!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.750
Sora-san! Sora-san!

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:55.660
Sora-san, hang in there!

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:58.170
I-I'm fine...

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:01.510
Sora!

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.480
Taichi...

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.910
Takeru...

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:30.360
<i>Unite your hearts and walk forth together,</i>

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:34.370
<i>then you shall open a new path.</i>

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:39.040
<i>I'll be by your side, Patamon.</i>

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.710
<i>That's right...</i>

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:47.300
<i>I've been in the darkness for a long time.</i>

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:50.430
<i>A dark and empty abyss.</i>

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:56.810
<i>I almost forgot who I was.</i>

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:00.100
<i>My mind...</i>

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.610
<i>almost faded away.</i>

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:06.530
<i>But...</i>

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:15.080
<i>Takeru!
But I never forgot about Takeru.</i>

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:19.640
<i>I never forgot,
because I knew I would meet him one day!</i>

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:23.920
<i>I never gave up! And neither did Takeru!</i>

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:27.830
<i>That's why we were able to meet!</i>

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:31.220
<i>Even after being reborn,
we were able to meet again.</i>

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:37.020
<i>The spirit to never give up...
Takeru is my hope.</i>

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:41.060
<i>And I am Takeru's hope...</i>

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:45.860
<i>And everyone's hope, the Holy Digimon!</i>

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:13.350
Takeru-kun, Patamon, run...

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:24.220
We're the only ones left now!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.980
But if we're together...

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:29.150
We can fight if we're together!

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.480
Even if I'm not Angemon...

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:35.370
We'll protect everyone together!

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:42.580
Patamon Evolution!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.810
Pegasmon!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.560
PEGASMON

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:01.890
Pegasmon!

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.580
That's...

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:06.770
A new evolution?!

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.270
Let's go, Pegasmon!

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:13.320
Yeah!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:23.210
Go, Pegasmon!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.590
Silver Blaze!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:31.470
Alright! Make a U-turn, Komondomon!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.260
Good, that's all of them.

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.980
Now then...

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:58.230
Pegasmon, aim for the mouth!

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.470
Rodeo Gallop!

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:35.250
Giga Destroyer!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.710
Silver Blaze!

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:06.930
Pegasmon, we did it.

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:08.280
Yeah.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:17.070
New wings... Hope...

00:22:31.180 --> 00:22:32.900
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.560
<i>Komondomon.</i>

00:22:35.560 --> 00:22:38.810
<i>This Digimon loves
to carry others and run.</i>

00:22:35.560 --> 00:22:38.810
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:40.860
TYPE: BEAST

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:43.070
<i>It seems they run around open fields
similar to how we take walks.</i>

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:43.070
SPECIAL MOVE: WI-WIPER / MASSHIGU-RUN

00:22:43.570 --> 00:22:45.480
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:50.280
<i>There are eight legs under the long fur,
and they can run through any terrain.</i>

00:22:50.280 --> 00:22:53.030
<i>Oh, and it'd be cool
if they could tap dance.</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>Can someone give them lessons?</i>

00:22:57.620 --> 00:23:00.260
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:04.880
<i>Hikari is swallowed into darkness!</i>

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:08.220
<i>Will Taichi be able to
rescue his little sister?!</i>

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:11.300
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Hikari of Dawn"</i>

00:23:11.300 --> 00:23:14.440
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
